          "titleColor": "#FFFFFF",
          "description": "An agent assesses research proposals for a European funding programme, on EU-made open models only (EuroLLM, on SUSE's vLLM) and air-gapped. It answers the applicant in their language, checks the proposal against the funding manual and briefs the programme officer in German. The officer decides; the agent can't approve, nor use any other model, enforced by its NVIDIA OpenShell sandbox.",
